        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8108RL-INT, Arched Rose with Rope Lever Interior Handleset Trim </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is replacement interior trim for Emtek Tubular Handlesets.  It is the interior rose and lever only and does not include the top deadbolt or the exterior handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Arched Rose with Rope Lever Interior Handleset Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as interior side lever portion only</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rope Lever and Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Finish: French Antique</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
